<title>HONG KONG: Fai Insurances Ltd sets US$75 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Fai Insurances Ltd sets US$75 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Westpac Banking Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER FAI INSURANCES LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$75 MLN    COUPON    3ML+130 BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	    ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCHED WK.07.APR</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES  END.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS   US$250K</p>
<p> RATING   NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY AUSTRALIA   GOV LAW   *	     PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>		  LEAD MANAGERS   US$10 MLN+ 100 BP  ALL-IN 150 BP</p>
<p>		SENIOR MANAGERS   US$5-9 MLN  85 BP  ALL-IN 147 BP</p>
<p>			 MANAGERS   US$3-4 MLN  65 BP  ALL-IN 143 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER WESTPAC BANKING CORP</p>
<p> NOTES    *AUSTRALIAN CAPITAL TERRITORY IS THE GOVERNING LAW</p>
<p>	    **ISSUED OFF US$150 MLN COMBINED EURO-DOMESTIC MTN</p>
<p>	    PROGRAMME WHICH ALLOWS THE ISSUER TO ACCESS BOTH THE</p>
<p>	    AUSTRALIA AND OFFSHORE DEBT MARKETS.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
